      "note": "desktop deltas: data layer swaps REST/SWR-fetchJSON for window.desktop IPC (listSchedules/createSchedule/updateSchedule/toggleSchedule/deleteSchedule/runSchedule) with a Task view model derived from Schedule+ScheduleRun; usePreferences -> useTranslations + language prop; composer submit calls onAskAI (switch to a fresh chat and auto-send) instead of location.assign('/?query='); attachments/library picker/SidebarTrigger/next-link removed (the + trigger keeps the web chat.uploadMenu label, its menu only lists manual creation); TaskEditor gains project/skill/MCP selects; extra run statuses (missed/skipped) and detail error codes localized in-component; IPC error messages localized via a local dictionary; header/h1/h2/article become divs because the app shell's unlayered global element rules (fixed 58px header, 23px h1, bordered article, borderless textarea) would override the tailwind utilities — the page module css restores the Textarea border/fill and wraps the page in TooltipProvider (no global provider in the desktop shell). All shared copy/labels/defaults (incl. the Asia/Shanghai timezone default) match the web catalog verbatim. Re-apply these edits after syncing."
